Description: Graph, mesh and hypergraph partitioning library (gnu15, OpenHPC)
 Scotch is a software package for graph and mesh/hypergraph partitioning and
 sparse matrix ordering. Built with the gnu15 compiler family (serial only).
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
